+*   **Color:** $\mathbf{c}_i$ (e.g., spherical harmonics coefficients) [S1].
+*   **Opacity:** $\alpha_i \in [0, 1]$ [S1].
+*   **Correction Factor:** $\psi \in \mathbb{R}$ (scalar) [S1].
 
