+*   **Kernel Type:** Half-cosine, Inverse MQ, etc. [S1].
+*   **Shape Parameter ($\xi$):** Controls the width of the half-cosine kernel. Typical values are not explicitly given, but $\beta=2$ is mentioned for modified half-cosine in Table 1 context (likely related to $\xi$ or variance scaling) [S1].
+*   **Correction Factor ($\psi$):** Scalar precomputed from regression. Specific values are not listed, but its inclusion improves metrics (Table 6) [S1].
 
